"""Theme rules for SUP (support) tickets and PHEM delivery items in the four CRM areas.

SUP_RULES[area] is an ordered list of (theme, [regex]); the first matching entry wins.
A theme may appear more than once so that specific phrases can win early and broad
phrases late. Patterns run case-insensitively on the SUP summary only. A ticket that
matches nothing stays Unclassified. Themes were derived by reading every SUP summary
created on or after 2026-01-01.

PHEM_RULES[area][theme] lists title phrases for Initiative / Epic / Story items in the
same area's 2026 PHEM pool. Matching is non-exclusive: one item may map to several
themes. PHEM_EXCLUDE drops known false positives per theme.
"""

